; Radio Mobile "Rainbow colors" 12-level DBM Signal Palette (rm_rainbow.dcf)
; Matches Radio Mobile 12-step scale (-60 to -100 dBm, step 4 dB):
;   -60 dBm : #FF1E50 (Crimson / Deep Rose Red)
;   -64 dBm : #FF6464 (Coral Red)
;   -68 dBm : #FFDC64 (Peach / Gold)
;   -72 dBm : #FFFF64 (Yellow)
;   -76 dBm : #64FF64 (Lime / Chartreuse)
;   -80 dBm : #64FF64 (Bright Green)
;   -84 dBm : #64FF64 (Light Green)
;   -88 dBm : #64FFC0 (Mint / Seafoam)
;   -92 dBm : #64FFFF (Cyan)
;   -96 dBm : #64DCFF (Sky Blue)
;  -100 dBm : #6464FF (Indigo / Blue)
; Format: dBm: red, green, blue
 -60: 255,  30,  80
 -64: 255, 100, 100
 -68: 255, 220, 100
 -72: 255, 255, 100
 -76: 192, 255, 100
 -80: 100, 255, 100
 -84: 100, 255, 100
 -88: 100, 255, 192
 -92: 100, 255, 255
 -96: 100, 220, 255
-100: 100, 100, 255
